# Context-root secret-exclusion backstop for the habenula-engine image build
# The authoritative ignore is the BuildKit-only
# packages/engine/Dockerfile.dockerignore; this root twin covers a legacy
# (non-BuildKit) builder, which silently skips the Dockerfile-adjacent form
# and reads only this file. Keep the two lists identical. **/.env and
# **/.dev.vars are the load-bearing entries — they keep real secrets out of
# the build context. Exact names, never .env* — .env.example must ship.
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/dist
**/.env
**/.dev.vars
.git
